"Therefore, my friends, let us deepen democracy by weaving permanent participatory institutions into the fabric of representative government—expanding participatory budgets, empowering citizens' assemblies, protecting civic associations, and affirming that democracy thrives only when every citizen exercises an active, ongoing voice."
],
